	(descr "Capacitive touch pad for the back face. Pad 1 is a comb electrode in exposed gold, pad 2 a ground guard bar. Comb is one net - the interleaving is visual, the sensing is self-capacitance, so the copper stays continuous. Mask is open over both so a bare finger meets ENIG gold.")
